*======================================================================*
* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - PARSER LOGIC                       *
*======================================================================*

* NOTE: In GPSS, parsing is typically handled via attribute manipulation
* or by splitting the transaction (SPLIT/ASSIGN). This block demonstrates
* how a parser might initialize transaction attributes.

BLOCKSIZE 80

title  DATA_PARSER_MODULE

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 1. TRANSACTION ARRIVAL & PARSING                                 *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
   GENERATE    -1,,50        * Arriving 50 raw records

* Simulate Parsing: Extract fields into attributes                 *
* In a real GPSS system, this might involve SPLIT or ASSIGN        *
* Here we simulate reading data into Attribute 1 and 2            *

   ASSIGN      1, 10         * Simulate Field 1 (e.g., ID)
   ASSIGN      2, 20         * Simulate Field 2 (e.g., Value)

* Validate Data Structure (Simulated)                             *
   IFN         1, 0, PARSE_FAIL

* Move to Processing Queue                                       *
   QUEUE       DATA_Q
   ENTER       PROCESS_F
   LEAVE       PROCESS_F
   TERMINATE     0           * End simulation (or continue to next stage)

PARSE_FAIL
   TERMINATE     0

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 2. FACILITIES & QUEUES                                         *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
   QUEUE       DATA_Q
   FACILITY    PROCESS_F

   START       1

END
